WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.990
=Episode 28=

01:33.539 --> 01:34.380
The lord and lady

01:34.380 --> 01:35.700
are really adaptable.

01:36.420 --> 01:37.900
Now that you're in a high position,

01:38.100 --> 01:39.620
they've become servile.

01:40.780 --> 01:41.780
But in my opinion,

01:42.100 --> 01:43.500
they agreed readily enough,

01:43.979 --> 01:45.500
but there's little sincerity.

01:45.979 --> 01:47.060
Sincere or not,

01:47.220 --> 01:48.100
it doesn't matter.

01:48.780 --> 01:49.900
I want them

01:50.100 --> 01:51.500
to bow their heads before Mother

01:51.539 --> 01:52.460
and admit their wrongs.

01:53.340 --> 01:54.140
But that is

01:54.420 --> 01:55.500
a very lenient punishment.

01:57.740 --> 01:58.700
Not at all.

01:59.500 --> 02:00.780
Their resentment is the point.

02:01.140 --> 02:02.380
Mother doesn't need

02:02.420 --> 02:03.580
fair-weather relationships.

02:04.700 --> 02:05.740
I want them

02:05.980 --> 02:06.860
to swallow their pride

02:07.380 --> 02:08.660
and humble themselves

02:08.820 --> 02:09.740
before Mother.

02:11.140 --> 02:12.420
Let them taste

02:13.020 --> 02:14.580
the humiliation Mother endured.

02:15.460 --> 02:16.940
Glad to see your wish was fulfilled.

02:18.380 --> 02:18.900
Not yet.

02:19.780 --> 02:20.500
What?

02:22.380 --> 02:22.900
Well.

02:23.380 --> 02:24.380
Are you done?

02:24.500 --> 02:25.500
Can we go take a walk?

02:26.460 --> 02:27.180
Why are you here?

02:27.579 --> 02:28.700
If you don't come to me,

02:29.020 --> 02:30.340
I'll come to you instead.

02:32.700 --> 02:33.820
I have official paperwork

02:34.260 --> 02:34.980
to complete.

02:36.300 --> 02:36.780
Chu Zhao,

02:37.140 --> 02:38.180
is it on purpose?

02:38.579 --> 02:40.220
It seems

02:40.540 --> 02:41.260
my paperwork needs

02:41.300 --> 02:42.220
your approval?

02:43.500 --> 02:44.940
That's not what I meant.

02:45.620 --> 02:46.900
Yingxiang, let's go back.

02:49.180 --> 02:49.700
What?

02:50.340 --> 02:51.100
Not even some tea

02:51.100 --> 02:52.180
for me?

02:52.740 --> 02:53.860
Must Lady Shijin

02:53.900 --> 02:54.980
personally host me?

02:55.500 --> 02:55.980
Sir.

02:56.460 --> 02:58.180
I'll prepare tea for Miss Xu

02:58.300 --> 02:59.100
and be back shortly.

03:07.700 --> 03:08.900
Aren't you serving me tea?

03:09.460 --> 03:09.980
Let's go.

03:14.700 --> 03:15.980
Enjoy your tea, Miss Xu.

03:19.380 --> 03:20.100
It's cold.

03:37.660 --> 03:39.540
This one seems scalding hot.

03:39.820 --> 03:40.820
Bring another cup.

03:44.780 --> 03:45.940
Is this

03:45.980 --> 03:46.980
how you treat guests?

03:47.380 --> 03:48.820
What has Chu Zhao taught you?

03:54.660 --> 03:55.860
Though I'm a servant,

03:56.180 --> 03:57.380
I keep proper decorum.

03:57.980 --> 03:59.020
You're a lady of status

03:59.620 --> 04:00.900
but lack dignity.

04:02.460 --> 04:03.060
How dare you?

04:03.460 --> 04:04.340
My young master

04:04.820 --> 04:05.900
taught me this.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.220
When above others,

04:07.580 --> 04:08.620
treat them as equals.

04:09.180 --> 04:10.060
When below others,

04:10.580 --> 04:11.540
maintain your integrity.

04:12.020 --> 04:12.900
I've learned it.

04:13.300 --> 04:14.140
I wonder

04:14.700 --> 04:15.900
if you've grasped it.

04:23.340 --> 04:24.740
If you're satisfied now,

04:25.420 --> 04:26.740
I'll take my leave.

04:45.740 --> 04:46.540
Father.

04:47.100 --> 04:47.580
Pingting.

04:47.780 --> 04:48.220
What's it?

04:48.500 --> 04:49.100
What happened?

04:49.860 --> 04:50.500
Tell me.

04:52.380 --> 04:54.260
He doesn't care about me at all.

04:54.860 --> 04:57.100
That's why he let that wretched maid

04:57.220 --> 04:58.740
humiliate me like this.

05:01.060 --> 05:01.740
Don't cry.

05:03.740 --> 05:05.900
I'll make this right for you.

05:08.740 --> 05:10.100
A mere fourth-rank official.

05:10.380 --> 05:12.660
Who does he think he is?

05:22.180 --> 05:22.820
Zilan.

05:23.460 --> 05:25.260
Aren't these hibiscus flowers

05:25.580 --> 05:27.580
laughable?

05:28.180 --> 05:28.740
Laughable?

05:29.300 --> 05:29.860
Yes.

05:30.300 --> 05:31.220
See how they

05:31.900 --> 05:33.820
bloom so vibrantly now.

05:34.100 --> 05:36.380
Unaware that winter's chill

05:36.659 --> 05:37.900
will soon arrive.

05:38.300 --> 05:40.140
When bitter winds blow,

05:40.940 --> 05:43.140
how long can they last?

05:47.140 --> 05:48.140
Your maid...

05:48.460 --> 05:49.820
What's her name?

05:55.940 --> 05:56.700
A lowly person.

05:57.220 --> 05:57.900
Not important.

06:01.900 --> 06:03.460
These gorgeous flowers

06:04.300 --> 06:06.540
can hardly survive winter

06:07.100 --> 06:09.900
without someone to shield them.

06:10.140 --> 06:13.020
Not to mention those worthless weeds.

06:13.820 --> 06:15.140
One careless mistake,

06:15.620 --> 06:18.540
and they'll end up
getting crushed underfoot.

06:20.620 --> 06:21.180
Zilan.

06:23.100 --> 06:23.940
What do you think?

06:29.180 --> 06:30.300
Thank you for the reminder.

06:31.180 --> 06:31.740
I know

06:32.620 --> 06:33.180
I was wrong.

07:10.420 --> 07:10.820
Rufei.

07:11.140 --> 07:11.580
Rufei.

07:11.860 --> 07:12.500
Are you okay?

07:13.540 --> 07:14.940
I'll fetch a physician for you.

07:17.180 --> 07:18.780
I'm the mighty General Feihong.

07:19.140 --> 07:20.300
A minor injury like this

07:20.660 --> 07:21.700
means nothing to me.

07:26.100 --> 07:26.620
Right.

07:28.620 --> 07:29.100
Rufei,

07:29.940 --> 07:32.060
you've been frail since childhood.

07:32.740 --> 07:34.700
I've always worried sick

07:34.980 --> 07:36.100
about you.

07:36.580 --> 07:38.500
But now, you command troops in battle

07:38.820 --> 07:39.500
and have become

07:39.659 --> 07:41.300
the true General Feihong.

08:23.820 --> 08:25.980
Young Master. Please take your medicine.

08:30.380 --> 08:30.940
Young Master.

08:31.940 --> 08:32.500
Your health

08:32.500 --> 08:33.539
has barely recovered.

08:34.460 --> 08:35.419
Don't stop the medicine.

08:56.060 --> 08:57.900
What's the use of recovering?

08:58.820 --> 09:00.180
I'm still trapped

09:00.220 --> 09:01.620
in this wretched courtyard,

09:02.740 --> 09:04.180
unable to go anywhere,

09:05.820 --> 09:06.740
and unable

09:07.860 --> 09:09.180
to do anything.

09:19.780 --> 09:21.460
What do you want to do?

09:26.100 --> 09:27.340
Who are you?

09:28.460 --> 09:29.740
Xu Jingfu.

09:31.060 --> 09:31.940
I know

09:32.500 --> 09:35.380
you're the real He Rufei.

09:41.860 --> 09:44.540
I am the real He Rufei.

09:54.100 --> 09:54.620
Sir,

09:56.180 --> 09:58.260
what brings you here?

09:59.340 --> 10:00.940
I can help you

10:01.460 --> 10:04.380
become the real General Feihong

10:05.420 --> 10:07.980
and achieve your deepest desires.

10:19.220 --> 10:20.020
What do you need

10:21.020 --> 10:21.820
me to do?

10:43.740 --> 10:44.540
(He Yan,)

10:45.580 --> 10:47.500
(every drop of blood I shed,)

10:48.340 --> 10:50.620
(you'll pay back in full.)

10:52.020 --> 10:53.420
(Times have changed.)

10:53.940 --> 10:55.780
(General Feihong's swordsmanship
is peerless,)

10:56.180 --> 10:58.500
(and he couldn't possibly be
an invalid.)

10:59.420 --> 11:01.100
(I can't be who I was before.)

11:07.500 --> 11:09.340
(Chai Anxi resents Xiao Zhongwu)

11:09.380 --> 11:10.620
(for warmongering)

11:11.060 --> 11:13.060
(and has long held grudges.)

11:13.660 --> 11:14.620
(Son Chai Qian)
(Recently,)

11:15.100 --> 11:17.820
(his only child died in battle,)

11:18.340 --> 11:21.580
(deepening his hatred for Xiao Zhongwu.)

11:22.740 --> 11:25.100
(We can exploit this.)

11:37.740 --> 11:39.900
You're General Feihong, He Rufei?

11:42.060 --> 11:43.700
Our family heirloom jade pendant

11:44.140 --> 11:45.940
is only passed
to the eldest legitimate son.

11:46.300 --> 11:47.300
But you're supposed to be

11:47.340 --> 11:48.580
on the front lines.

11:48.940 --> 11:50.660
You want revenge for your son,

11:50.860 --> 11:51.380
don't you?

11:54.060 --> 11:56.540
I can help you.

12:01.820 --> 12:03.100
That message-carrying lieutenant

12:03.740 --> 12:04.540
was later killed

12:04.580 --> 12:05.980
by Ding Yi in battle.

12:07.220 --> 12:08.380
Flawlessly executed.

12:09.100 --> 12:10.020
That's why Xiao Jue

12:10.180 --> 12:11.500
couldn't find any evidence.

12:12.580 --> 12:13.820
I never imagined

12:14.820 --> 12:15.660
you'd done so much

12:15.700 --> 12:16.900
for Chancellor Xu.

12:17.180 --> 12:18.660
My son!

12:19.460 --> 12:20.900
Each of these deeds

12:21.020 --> 12:21.860
warrants beheading

12:21.900 --> 12:23.540
or even clan extermination.

12:24.780 --> 12:25.420
Chancellor Xu

12:25.660 --> 12:26.380
just wants

12:26.420 --> 12:27.260
an obedient general

12:27.300 --> 12:28.780
to counter the Xiao Army.

12:29.420 --> 12:31.020
But if things go wrong,

12:31.140 --> 12:31.700
the blame

12:31.860 --> 12:33.420
will fall solely on you.

12:33.780 --> 12:34.660
I'm not afraid of him.

12:36.020 --> 12:37.860
I'm not his pawn.

12:39.860 --> 12:40.420
I am

12:41.620 --> 12:44.180
the undeniable proof of his guilt.

12:44.620 --> 12:45.220
But...

12:45.260 --> 12:45.940
Father.

12:46.500 --> 12:48.620
As the eldest son
of our family's main lineage,

12:49.060 --> 12:50.180
everything I've done

12:50.740 --> 12:51.820
has been to strengthen

12:51.860 --> 12:53.060
our main lineage.

12:53.740 --> 12:55.020
So, from now on,

12:55.460 --> 12:56.740
no matter what happens,

12:57.180 --> 12:58.140
both of us

12:58.580 --> 13:00.100
must stand united.

13:01.260 --> 13:01.940
Understand?

13:05.420 --> 13:05.980
Yes.

13:07.540 --> 13:10.420
I understand.

13:13.860 --> 13:14.380
Father,

13:15.860 --> 13:17.420
He Yan isn't actually dead.

13:18.660 --> 13:19.140
What?

13:20.020 --> 13:21.860
And she's about to return.

13:24.300 --> 13:25.500
But rest assured.

13:26.580 --> 13:27.260
I absolutely

13:28.060 --> 13:29.900
won't let her enter the capital alive.

13:36.820 --> 13:37.460
Gentlemen,

13:37.700 --> 13:38.300
you look weary.

13:38.940 --> 13:39.700
Please come inside.

13:42.050 --> 13:47.300
(Prosperity Inn)

13:49.620 --> 13:50.500
As we're near Yaojing,

13:50.620 --> 13:51.940
Yan He has vanished.

13:52.220 --> 13:53.700
Seems he's eager to return home.

13:55.180 --> 13:56.180
Sir, your tea.

13:57.340 --> 13:58.540
His wife is pregnant.

13:59.620 --> 14:00.300
He's concerned.

14:02.340 --> 14:03.340
You'll be home soon too.

14:04.620 --> 14:05.020
Right.

14:07.860 --> 14:08.380
That's good.

14:35.900 --> 14:38.020
Where will you stay?

14:40.580 --> 14:41.140
I...

14:41.860 --> 14:43.540
I'll just stay at any inn.

14:44.180 --> 14:45.780
I have recently received some rewards.

14:45.980 --> 14:46.940
So I'm better off now.

14:51.300 --> 14:51.660
Waiter.

14:51.700 --> 14:52.380
Two steamed buns.

14:52.740 --> 14:53.180
Coming.

15:05.300 --> 15:06.700
Why not stay at the Xiao Mansion?

15:07.060 --> 15:07.900
It has a big yard.

15:08.220 --> 15:09.380
And you're Commander's man.

15:09.980 --> 15:10.700
It's appropriate

15:11.020 --> 15:11.500
to be there.

15:15.380 --> 15:15.860
No need.

15:15.860 --> 15:16.180
Okay.

15:16.180 --> 15:16.500
I...

15:49.100 --> 15:49.820
Gentlemen,

15:50.180 --> 15:51.980
our freshest tea.

15:52.740 --> 15:54.260
Please enjoy.

16:05.260 --> 16:05.620
Here.

16:06.060 --> 16:06.700
Sir.

16:08.020 --> 16:08.740
Gentlemen,

16:08.980 --> 16:09.620
fresh tea.

16:09.940 --> 16:11.500
It's best enjoyed while hot.

16:11.900 --> 16:12.300
Alright.

16:37.300 --> 16:37.620
Go.

16:37.860 --> 16:38.740
Who sent you?

16:56.980 --> 16:57.380
Commander,

16:57.780 --> 16:59.180
these men seem to be targeting you.

17:01.340 --> 17:02.180
I have many enemies.

18:11.980 --> 18:12.900
Don't fear. All's well.

18:43.100 --> 18:43.740
It appears

18:44.300 --> 18:45.380
they're after me.

18:47.300 --> 18:47.860
Are you hurt?

18:50.540 --> 18:51.060
I'm fine.

18:51.420 --> 18:52.420
They couldn't defeat me.

19:07.460 --> 19:08.380
Suicide operatives

19:08.740 --> 19:09.860
with poison in their teeth.

19:10.900 --> 19:11.540
They took it

19:11.580 --> 19:12.380
when cornered.

19:12.700 --> 19:13.620
We're in Chonghuai.

19:14.500 --> 19:15.860
I'll have Yang Mingzhi

19:16.300 --> 19:17.580
from the county office come

19:18.700 --> 19:19.860
and look into their origins.

19:21.660 --> 19:22.140
Okay.

19:23.300 --> 19:24.180
But I know

19:25.100 --> 19:26.140
who sent these assassins

19:26.180 --> 19:27.180
without an investigation.

19:30.140 --> 19:31.780
They've tried to kill me again.

19:36.290 --> 19:38.430
(Chu Mansion)

20:16.100 --> 20:16.940
My painting is crude.

20:17.060 --> 20:17.700
Don't look.

20:20.780 --> 20:22.060
The essence of painting plums

20:22.380 --> 20:23.700
lies in layering and variation.

20:26.740 --> 20:27.180
Like this.

20:35.340 --> 20:35.700
Here.

20:48.260 --> 20:48.780
Zilan.

20:52.340 --> 20:52.980
My bad.

20:53.940 --> 20:54.380
It's okay.

20:54.900 --> 20:55.740
I'll get changed

20:56.020 --> 20:56.660
and return soon.

22:14.140 --> 22:14.660
Sorry.

22:15.820 --> 22:17.100
Our plum painting is unfinished.

22:18.020 --> 22:18.580
Continue?

22:21.780 --> 22:22.340
Yes.

22:32.500 --> 22:33.100
Here, look.

22:40.300 --> 22:41.060
(Yaojing City)
Pendants.

22:43.540 --> 22:44.460
Come and take a look.

22:54.880 --> 22:57.060
(Yaojing City)

22:57.660 --> 22:59.300
- General Feihong!
- General Feihong!

22:59.500 --> 23:00.860
- General Feihong!
- General Feihong!

23:00.940 --> 23:02.100
Do you intend to cling to

23:02.420 --> 23:03.860
an identity that isn't yours

23:04.180 --> 23:05.100
forever?

23:06.380 --> 23:07.020
But

23:07.540 --> 23:08.980
your current achievements

23:09.260 --> 23:10.260
are entirely built upon

23:10.540 --> 23:12.460
being the He family's legitimate heir.

23:17.940 --> 23:18.540
Yaojing.

23:20.380 --> 23:21.740
I've finally returned.

23:25.580 --> 23:26.820
I've sent people to Huayuan

23:27.500 --> 23:28.060
to look for

23:28.540 --> 23:29.180
evidence.

23:29.740 --> 23:30.220
Besides,

23:30.940 --> 23:31.420
recently,

23:31.420 --> 23:32.660
I received a letter from home.

23:33.260 --> 23:34.540
We're commanded to attend

23:35.140 --> 23:36.020
the Mid-Autumn banquet

23:36.980 --> 23:37.700
at the palace.

23:40.460 --> 23:40.980
By then,

23:41.580 --> 23:43.180
Xu Jingfu and He Rufei

23:43.500 --> 23:44.540
will surely attend.

23:46.860 --> 23:47.780
They must have received

23:47.820 --> 23:49.020
news of our return.

23:50.100 --> 23:51.660
But under the Emperor's watchful eye

23:52.260 --> 23:53.620
and considering our positions,

23:54.380 --> 23:55.740
they won't make any moves

23:56.500 --> 23:57.780
before the Mid-Autumn banquet.

23:58.340 --> 23:59.980
You're General Fengyun,

24:00.580 --> 24:02.140
and I'm Attendant Wu'an.

24:03.260 --> 24:04.020
We should naturally

24:04.340 --> 24:05.980
enter the palace banquet with dignity.

24:06.700 --> 24:08.140
If He Rufei

24:08.300 --> 24:09.580
provokes us,

24:10.260 --> 24:10.860
I'm not afraid.

24:12.020 --> 24:12.540
But if he

24:13.340 --> 24:14.380
avoids confronting me,

24:15.740 --> 24:17.180
I'll certainly seek him out.

24:17.900 --> 24:18.820
I'll plant suspicion

24:19.580 --> 24:20.780
in mind of His Majesty

24:21.060 --> 24:22.300
and the court officials.

24:24.420 --> 24:25.340
General He,

24:25.540 --> 24:26.900
you're meticulously planning

24:27.260 --> 24:28.220
every move.

24:28.860 --> 24:30.580
By the end of the Mid-Autumn banquet,

24:31.740 --> 24:32.500
the investigation

24:32.580 --> 24:34.140
in Huayuan will have yielded results.

24:35.180 --> 24:35.980
Then,

24:36.620 --> 24:37.820
we'll determine our next steps

24:38.380 --> 24:39.940
based on the situation.

24:40.900 --> 24:41.940
Stolen things

24:42.780 --> 24:44.540
must eventually be returned.

24:45.140 --> 24:45.900
He Rufei,

24:46.940 --> 24:47.780
between you and me,

24:48.980 --> 24:50.580
it's a fight to the death.

24:59.860 --> 25:00.260
Sir,

25:00.740 --> 25:01.660
the Master and Mistress

25:01.700 --> 25:02.740
ask you to have dinner.

25:05.740 --> 25:06.100
Sir,

25:06.420 --> 25:06.700
your

25:06.940 --> 25:07.660
jade pendant...

25:32.580 --> 25:35.680
(Xiao Mansion)

25:56.180 --> 25:56.620
Jing.

25:57.620 --> 25:58.100
Madam.

26:00.260 --> 26:01.140
You're finally back.

26:02.220 --> 26:02.740
I'm back

26:03.500 --> 26:04.340
with a friend.

26:05.900 --> 26:06.580
This is He Yan.

26:09.940 --> 26:10.620
I am He Yan.

26:11.260 --> 26:12.620
Mr. Xiao and Madam.

26:13.060 --> 26:14.380
So you're Huaijin's friend.

26:15.020 --> 26:15.940
How extraordinary.

26:16.340 --> 26:17.460
We've never seen Huaijin

26:17.540 --> 26:18.660
bring friends home before.

26:19.060 --> 26:20.140
Your friendship must be

26:20.340 --> 26:21.020
exceptional.

26:22.940 --> 26:23.660
Good to see you.

26:23.940 --> 26:25.140
Rongwei personally made dinner

26:25.660 --> 26:26.740
while awaiting your return.

26:28.140 --> 26:28.620
I want

26:29.220 --> 26:30.500
to first see Father and Mother.

26:36.800 --> 26:39.620
(Ancestral Tablets of the Xiao Clan)

26:54.190 --> 26:57.080
(Xiao)

26:57.080 --> 26:59.680
(Commemoration)

27:16.180 --> 27:16.620
(Jing,)

27:17.660 --> 27:18.780
(only by retaking Que City)

27:19.220 --> 27:22.460
(can we uncover the truth of Mingshui,
clear Father's name,)

27:22.780 --> 27:24.380
(and honor the 30,000 fallen men.)

27:25.540 --> 27:26.100
(I)

27:27.100 --> 27:28.340
(deserve to die for this.)

27:55.060 --> 27:55.500
Mr. He,

27:58.140 --> 27:59.300
he's been away so long.

27:59.940 --> 28:00.860
Let him spend time

28:01.260 --> 28:02.180
with Father and Mother.

28:03.660 --> 28:04.260
How about

28:04.660 --> 28:05.740
we wait in the parlour?

28:08.500 --> 28:08.940
After you.

28:17.500 --> 28:18.860
Ancestors,

28:19.460 --> 28:20.260
your descendant,

28:20.540 --> 28:21.540
Xiao Jue, have returned.

28:22.140 --> 28:23.100
This time,

28:24.020 --> 28:25.100
I will surely expose

28:25.140 --> 28:26.140
the disloyal officials,

28:27.380 --> 28:28.420
purge the imperial court,

28:29.180 --> 28:30.700
clear our family's name,

28:30.980 --> 28:32.420
and get justice for our army.

28:34.580 --> 28:35.740
May you protect us.

28:48.960 --> 28:51.680
(Tablet of Father Xiao Zhongwu)

28:59.260 --> 28:59.980
(Tablet of Mother Song Wan)
Father, Mother,

29:00.780 --> 29:01.700
I have something

29:02.660 --> 29:03.660
to tell you.

29:06.300 --> 29:07.820
I've found the most significant person

29:08.460 --> 29:09.420
in my life.

29:10.180 --> 29:11.820
But she still has unfinished matters.

29:12.420 --> 29:13.820
When everything settles down,

29:14.700 --> 29:15.580
I'll surely bring her

29:16.420 --> 29:17.060
to meet you.

29:31.900 --> 29:32.620
These coming days,

29:32.860 --> 29:34.060
I'll be troubling you

29:34.180 --> 29:34.900
and your wife.

29:35.300 --> 29:36.500
No need for formalities.

29:36.780 --> 29:38.020
Since you're Huaijin's friend,

29:38.220 --> 29:39.220
you're our friend too.

29:39.540 --> 29:41.140
Treat this place as your own home.

29:41.420 --> 29:42.860
Stay as long as you wish.

29:42.900 --> 29:43.700
Just relax.

29:44.820 --> 29:45.780
Don't trouble yourself.

29:46.380 --> 29:47.060
The guest room

29:47.260 --> 29:48.460
to my west will be fine.

29:49.700 --> 29:50.220
Huaijin,

29:51.300 --> 29:52.940
didn't you always prefer tranquility?

29:53.420 --> 29:54.940
Why this sudden change?

29:59.060 --> 30:00.540
It seems Huaijin and Mr. He

30:00.620 --> 30:01.420
get along well.

30:02.180 --> 30:02.780
Eat a lot.

30:17.540 --> 30:18.820
The mushroom and chicken stew.

30:20.340 --> 30:21.220
Your favorite.

30:21.580 --> 30:22.100
Eat it.

30:23.300 --> 30:24.180
You remember?

30:27.380 --> 30:28.100
Your favorite.

30:28.380 --> 30:29.220
Of course, I do.

30:30.980 --> 30:33.060
You two share a brotherly bond.

30:34.140 --> 30:35.620
He's never shown this level of care

30:35.780 --> 30:37.060
toward me as his elder brother.

30:41.500 --> 30:42.900
Eat a lot.

30:52.700 --> 30:53.180
Eat.

31:01.340 --> 31:01.820
Miss,

31:02.220 --> 31:02.900
come take a look.

31:04.290 --> 31:05.620
How terribly rude of me

31:05.980 --> 31:07.180
to visit Mr. and Mrs. Xiao

31:07.220 --> 31:08.380
without bringing gifts.

31:08.580 --> 31:09.500
I came empty-handed.

31:16.780 --> 31:18.020
What should I buy?

31:27.220 --> 31:28.460
You're sent by He Rufei, right?

31:28.940 --> 31:29.420
Sir,

31:29.500 --> 31:30.180
what?

31:30.580 --> 31:31.700
I'm merely passing through.

31:33.420 --> 31:34.660
I'll spare you today.

31:35.180 --> 31:36.420
Tell your master.

31:37.020 --> 31:37.660
Your debt

31:38.300 --> 31:39.380
will be paid.

31:46.140 --> 31:46.580
Sir,

31:47.220 --> 31:48.500
our people

31:48.660 --> 31:49.740
were discovered by He Yan.

31:55.580 --> 31:56.300
"Discovered"?

32:00.140 --> 32:00.780
Young Master,

32:00.940 --> 32:01.580
I am useless.

32:01.620 --> 32:03.100
You failed at both tracking

32:03.540 --> 32:04.980
and assassination.

32:05.260 --> 32:05.700
Useless!

32:09.660 --> 32:10.460
Where is she now?

32:11.260 --> 32:11.940
In the mansion?

32:12.540 --> 32:12.980
No.

32:13.340 --> 32:13.780
She said,

32:14.060 --> 32:14.660
"Your debt

32:14.900 --> 32:15.660
will be paid."

32:20.460 --> 32:20.940
Right.

32:22.260 --> 32:23.500
Now that she's in the capital,

32:24.860 --> 32:27.420
it's either her destruction or ours.

32:35.540 --> 32:36.820
Let's go to that cosmetics shop

32:36.860 --> 32:38.260
we went to the other day?

32:38.300 --> 32:38.660
Okay.

32:48.070 --> 32:50.230
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:50.330 --> 32:54.250
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:54.430 --> 32:56.370
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:56.470 --> 33:01.400
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:13.490 --> 33:14.900
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:15.100 --> 33:16.510
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:16.780 --> 33:19.600
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:19.900 --> 33:21.290
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:21.350 --> 33:22.750
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:22.900 --> 33:24.700
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

33:25.900 --> 33:27.370
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:27.540 --> 33:28.820
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:29.000 --> 33:31.390
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:31.590 --> 33:33.640
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:34.780 --> 33:36.610
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:38.570 --> 33:41.480
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:41.570 --> 33:44.240
♪There must always be a longing♪

33:44.690 --> 33:49.750
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

33:50.090 --> 33:52.090
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:52.410 --> 33:56.050
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:56.290 --> 33:58.180
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:58.210 --> 34:02.060
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:02.410 --> 34:04.350
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:04.540 --> 34:08.360
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:08.620 --> 34:14.370
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:15.260 --> 34:20.719
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

